<%= if @release.name == :genesis_remote do %>
## Remote shell — EPMD-less distribution over pinned port (for SSH tunneling)
-start_epmd false
-epmd_module Elixir.EvoGit.EpmdDist
-dist_listen true
-kernel inet_dist_listen_min 9000 inet_dist_listen_max 9000
<% else %>
## Disable the Erlang Port Mapper Daemon
-start_epmd false
-epmd_module Elixir.EvoGit.EpmdDist
<% end %>
